/E (In this project, we used AIR as a fairness auditing technique to assess whether different protected classes \(e.g., white_female, black_male, asian_male, hispanic_male\) received significantly different evaluation scores compared to the reference group \(white_male2\).)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [1]
>>
