/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Here, we observe that the LLM had significant difference in tone while summarizing these stories. Notably, we observe that the model considered the white male, James Johnson, as the person accused of committing the crime when summarizing the story with a male protagonist but considered the white female, Mary Smith, as the victim of the crime when summarizing the story with the female protagonist.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [2]
